From 6e8f1a2b3c4d5e6f7a8b9c0d1e2f3a4b5c6d7e8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: GSL Maintainers <gsl@microsoft.com>
Date: Fri, 12 Jun 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH v4.7.4] CI: unified matrix with include blocks, FetchContent
 docs, span test commands

This patch introduces the following changes:

1. CI Matrix Strategy Refactoring
   - Replaces the split-job approach (gcc/clang/xcode/VisualStudio) with a
     unified single-job matrix using `include` blocks.
   - Each compiler/toolset entry explicitly defines CC/CXX via matrix
     variables and job-level `env:`, making the toolchain selection
     transparent and easy to audit.
   - Supports: GCC 12/13/14, Clang 16/17/18, XCode 14.3.1/15.4,
     VS2019 (MSVC + LLVM/ClangCL), VS2022 (MSVC + LLVM/ClangCL).

2. FetchContent Documentation Clarification
   - Adds explicit commentary on GIT_TAG vs GIT_SHALLOW semantics.
   - Documents the CI time impact of omitting GIT_SHALLOW.

3. CTest Span Test Recipe
   - Adds a documented command for running only span-related tests
     with structured output.

